name": "saturation_mix", "label": "saturation_mix", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "saturation_mix"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 28, "type": "FastFilmGrain", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "FastFilmGrain"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [27], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [717.203125, 228.578125], "pos": [844.5667724609375, 463.24017333984375], "widgets_values": ["A vertical, cinematic masterpiece capturing the serene melancholy of the Qingming Festival (Pure Brightness), rendered in a hyper-detailed, ethereal style reminiscent of classical Chinese ink wash paintings fused with modern digital realism. The scene is dominated by a misty, jade-green palette — cool teals, muted emeralds, and soft grays — evoking the damp, quiet atmosphere of spring rain. Towering, jagged mountains rise majestically on either side, their peaks shrouded in swirling fog that diffuses the ambient light into a soft, luminous glow. Delicate, almost translucent rain streaks fall vertically across the entire frame, catching the light like fine silver threads, enhancing the sense of gentle motion and stillness.\n\nIn the foreground, a calm, mirror-like river reflects the surrounding landscape with perfect clarity — the silhouettes of pine trees, the distant hills, and even the falling rain are mirrored beneath the surface. Atop a dark, muscular water buffalo standing waist-deep in the water sits a small child, barefoot and dressed in simple, earth-toned traditional garments — perhaps a pale pink or ochre tunic and loose trousers — their posture relaxed, gazing ahead as if lost in contemplation. The child’s skin appears smooth and dew-kissed, subtly highlighted by the diffused daylight filtering through the clouds above.\n\nThe background is layered with dense forests of tall, slender conifers and broadleaf trees, their leaves glistening with moisture, creating rich textural contrast against the softer mists. A single red circular seal stamp bearing white Chinese characters (“二十四节气” — Twenty-Four Solar Terms) floats near the center-right, adding a touch of cultural authenticity and visual warmth to the cool-toned composition. Dominating the upper third of the image are two large, bold calligraphic characters — “清明” (Qingming) — painted in flowing white brushstrokes with subtle ink bleed effects, giving them an organic, hand-painted feel. Below, smaller text reads “[清明·时节]” and “清明时节情谊浓，踏青祭祖念先人,” followed by the English translation “PURE BRIGHTNESS” in clean, minimalist sans-serif font.\n\nThe lighting is soft and directional, coming from behind the mountain peaks, casting long, gentle shadows across the valley floor while illuminating the mist with a heavenly radiance. The overall mood is one of peaceful reverence, quiet nostalgia, and natural harmony — a moment suspended between memory and presence, where nature and tradition intertwine under the whispering rain. Every element — from the texture of the buffalo’s wet hide to the ripples distorting the reflection — is rendered with meticulous attention to detail, inviting the viewer into a world both dreamlike and deeply real."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 31, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 103, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 24, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [38], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [2031.4490966796875, 269.95159912109375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 23, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 24, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 17, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["模拟噪点质感"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [275.6566467285156, 95.6023178100586], "pos": [1930.1119384765625, -69.50408172607422], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [101, 104], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [322.8977966308594, 121.57750701904297], "color": "rgba(27, 89, 123, 0.7)", "pos": [2216.291015625, 63.05419921875], "widgets_values": [0.9000000000000001, 1.2000000000000002, 0.8000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 37, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "brightness"}, "name": "brightness", "label": "brightness", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "brightness"}, {"widget": {"name": "contrast"}, "name": "contrast", "label": "contrast", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "contrast"}, {"widget": {"name": "saturation"}, "name": "saturation", "label": "saturation", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "saturation"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "LayerColor: BrightnessContrastV2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerColor: BrightnessContrastV2"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [399.837158203125, 696.6226806640625], "pos": [65.70741271972656, 297.5516662597656], "widgets_values": ["这是一份为您精心设计的**51 劳动节海报视觉方案**。该方案严格遵循您提出的\"3D 插画结合扁平化元素”、“高饱和色彩对比”及“分层城市场景”等要求，旨在打造一张既具现代科技感又充满人文温度的节日宣传海报。\n\n### 🎨 核心视觉概念：光影交织的劳动赞歌\n\n#### 1. 色彩策略 (Color Palette)\n*   **主色调（鲜红色 #FF3B3B）**：用于主标题、人物服饰亮点及关键装饰，象征热情、活力与节日的喜庆，第一时间抓住视线。\n*   **辅助色（金黄色 #FFD700）**：用于光晕、文字描边、地面反光及飘浮粒子，营造温暖、荣耀的庆典氛围，提升画面层次感。\n*   **强调色（翡翠绿 #2ECC71）**：用于背景中的树木、鲜花及部分机械元素，平衡红色的视觉冲击，带来生机与希望。\n*   **背景色**：明亮的天空蓝与高反光玻璃白，通过高对比度衬托前景的高饱和主体。\n\n#### 2. 构图与布局 (Composition)\n*   **中心构图**：五位核心劳动者呈半圆形或错落有致地排列于画面视觉中心，形成稳固的三角形或弧形结构，确保视觉聚焦。\n*   **分层空间**：\n    *   **远景**：现代摩天大楼群，玻璃幕墙反射蓝天白云，营造都市宏大背景。\n    *   **中景**：整洁的街道，两侧绿树成荫，点缀盛开的鲜花，街道地面有清晰的倒影。\n    *   **近景**：地面散落抽象的劳动符号（齿轮、扳手、螺丝），部分融入地面纹理，部分作为独立元素。\n*   **留白设计**：顶部标题区、底部文案区保留适当呼吸空间，确保文字信息清晰可读，不遮挡人物面部表情。\n\n#### 3. 主体人物设计 (Characters)\n*   **风格融合**：采用**3D 渲染材质**（写实皮肤质感、衣物褶皱、金属光泽）结合**扁平化构图**（清晰的轮廓、简化的肢体语言），使人物既真实可感又具有海报的艺术张力。\n*   **人物群像**：\n    1.  **建筑工人**：头戴安全帽，身穿反光背心，手持图纸或工具，眼神坚定自信。\n    2.  **医生**：身穿白大褂，手持听诊器，面带微笑，传递专业与关怀。\n    3.  **教师**：身着休闲衬衫，手捧书本或教案，姿态优雅，流露知识的光芒。\n    4.  **保洁员**：推着清洁车，身着整洁工装，动作轻快，展现城市之美。\n    5.  **外卖骑手**：头戴头盔，背着配送箱，步伐活力，象征城市的流动脉搏。\n*   **神态与动作**：所有人物均**面带笑容**，姿态舒展活力，彼此之间虽无直接肢体接触，但通过眼神交流和姿态呼应，传递出“团结”与“共同奋斗”的默契。\n\n#### 4. 文字排版 (Typography)\n*   **顶部主标题**：\"**五一劳动节**\"\n    *   字体：粗重无衬线字体（如 Bold Sans-Serif），字重极粗。\n    *   特效：**红金渐变**填充，带有强烈的**3D 立体厚度**，并勾勒**金色描边**，产生金属质感，悬浮于人物上方。\n*   **中部副标题**：\"**尊重劳动，歌颂劳动者**\"\n    *   字体：深红色衬线字体（如 Elegant Serif），带有细微的投影，增加正式感与庄重感。\n*   **底部落款**：\"**五一劳动节快乐**\" 及简约宣传语。\n    *   字体：淡金色手写体或简约无衬线体，字号适中，作为情感升华的点睛之笔。\n\n#### 5. 光影与氛围 (Lighting & Atmosphere)\n*   **主光源**：来自画面**左上方**的柔和明亮光源，模拟自然晨光或庆典灯光。\n    *   在人物头顶和肩膀处形成自然的**柔和高光**，勾勒人物轮廓。\n    *   在地面、玻璃幕墙和金属工具上形成**清晰的反射与高光**，增强材质真实感。\n*   **环境光**：整体笼罩在**暖黄色**环境光中，营造温馨、热烈的节日气氛。\n*   **特效增强**：人物周围环绕**金色光晕**，空中漂浮着细微的**微光粒子**，增加画面的梦幻感与神圣感，强化“劳动光荣”的主题升华。\n\n#### 6. 应用场景"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 76, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable":